    "type": "effect",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You failed your save against @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-netherworld.effects.Item.nwQueensRimeFx01]{the Queen of Shadows' rime} &mdash; the cold locks your joints. You are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1} and take a <strong>&minus;10-foot status penalty to all your Speeds</strong> while the rime grips you.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>On a critical failure</strong>, raise the granted condition to <strong>Clumsy 2</strong> (the Speed penalty is unchanged). Remove this effect once the creature is no longer clumsy from the rime &mdash; it leaves the emanation, or the Glass reaches Broken and the rime ends.</p>"
